-- Documentation and argument notes:
--   SECTION: RANDOM
--   SECTION: Syntax
--   SECTION: Purpose
--   RANDOM() generates a pseudo-random number that is a 64-bit integer.
--   • seed is an integer. The generated array of random numbers varies with the value of seed.
--   • RANDOM() uses the MT19937 algorithm to generate pseudo-random numbers. This algorithm ensures a wide range for random numbers and generates a repeated array only after generating 219937 - 1 random elements.
