-- Category: SQL function reference
-- Official source: https://github.com/oceanbase/oceanbase-doc/blob/017c8d35a015afa04ce1e1ce4b95675e3223c878/en-US/700.reference/500.sql-reference/100.sql-syntax/200.common-tenant-of-mysql-mode/400.functions-of-mysql-mode/700.json-functions-of-mysql-mode/400.return-json-text-property-function-of-mysql-mode/300.json-type-of-mysql-mode.md
